Z||000004||Bob Englert||12-13-2000||08:22 PM||||I'm not in WV but reasonably close in Greensboro, NC.  One of my favorite Fiero roads is between Welch-Coalwood-War-Tazwell, VA.  That drive is a blast!  I plan to explore a lot more southern VW and SW VA roads next spring and summer.<P>If you want to make a road trip consider stopping in Greensboro this Saturday.  We are trying to get a group of NC Fiero owners together for lunch at the Golden Corral just off I-40 at exit 214.  We are planing to meet at 2PM this Saturday.<P>Otherwise maybe we can meet up some weekend in the spring and blast through the hills.<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
