Z||000006||007DOUG||12-14-2000||12:00 AM||||How many times have you guys heard "West Virginia?....Is that the western part of Virginia?"<P>Most folks don't even know we're a state.<P>------------------<BR>5 Indy pace Cars<BR>84 T-top<BR>84 SE<BR>86 SE V6 153K<BR>86 GT<BR>86 GT now with a 4:10<BR>86 GT 3.4 Pearl White T-top<BR>2 88 GT's (twins)<P>However......<BR><I>"Time is my most precious and most perishable of all my possessions."</I>||||reg||1
