Z||000009||varnster||12-16-2000||06:00 PM||||Bob, I grew up just outside Tazewell VA.<BR>A little place called Rosedale just be<BR>careful on those curving backroads you<BR>will be loking at your tail lights before<BR>you know it.I crossed my 85 gt up several<BR>times. Im going that way for Christmas,<BR>to visit familey.<P><BR>||||reg||1
